  "description": "COMPACT, CONNECTED, AND EASY TO HANDLE\n\nThe battery can be easily removed from the top of the down tube, while the internal cable routing keeps the design clean. Its low center of gravity ensures stability and control at all times.\n\nBOSCH PERFORMANCE LINE CX MOTOR\n\nCompact, powerful, and ready for any challenge. Weighing just 2.8 kg, it delivers 120 Nm of torque and up to 400% assistance.\n\nPerfect for tackling steep climbs and flying down descents with total agility.\n\n800WH BATTERY\n\nThe 800Wh removable battery provides up to 195 km of range and supports fast charging up to 80%.\n\nKIOX 300 DISPLAY + LED REMOTE\n\nThe Kiox 300 is the compact sport display every rider needs. It shows speed, range, assistance level, heart rate, and turn-by-turn navigation via the eBike Flow app. Connected to the Bosch eBike Flow app, it allows system updates, route logging, and settings adjustments directly from your phone.\n\nThe ergonomic, compact LED Remote lets you control everything without letting go of the handlebars—switch modes, manage functions, and keep your eyes on the trail.\n\nCUSTOMIZED RIDE: 120MM\n\nWith 120 mm of suspension seamlessly integrated into the top tube, the Atom+ NX SUV is a lightweight and agile partner for all kinds of rides. Ideal for riders who want the perfect balance of climbing efficiency, precise handling on technical trails, and fast, responsive performance as the terrain changes.",
